<title>USA: Burlington, N.J., bonds won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Burlington, N.J., bonds won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said Thursday it won Burlington, N.J.'s unlimited tax bond issue with a bid of 100.133 and a 5.20 percent coupon. The firm said it eliminated $68,000 of bonds, bringing the deal's total to $50.932 million.</p>
</text>
